# Line-ending law for this repo (PUBLIC).
# Windows checkouts default to CRLF — a CRLF .sh dies on the VPS (shebang + \r in every arg) and a
# CRLF-mangled /etc/backup/env hangs restic. Shell scripts here MUST ship LF; batch files CRLF.
*.sh text eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
# Git hooks are shell scripts without an extension.
.githooks/* text eol=lf
# Generated by scripts/llm_context.py (never hand-edit or hand-merge: regenerate); GitHub collapses it in diffs.
LLM_CONTEXT.md text eol=lf linguist-generated=true
